WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.871 --> 00:00:15.372
Dad moved his desk into the attic.

2
00:00:16.172 --> 00:00:18.333
He filled the bookcase with his books.

3
00:00:19.513 --> 00:00:25.235
When Dad wasn't looking, Vinnie and Mandy hid the photo album.

4
00:00:26.375 --> 00:00:29.836
They put it in a bag and stuffed it far under his desk.

5
00:00:31.168 --> 00:00:34.329
"Dad's feet will never reach it," said Mandy.

6
00:00:34.349 --> 00:00:39.230
"Hopefully he won't look under there," Vinnie added.

7
00:00:40.471 --> 00:00:43.271
But a week later something terrible happened.

8
00:00:43.291 --> 00:00:46.092
"The bag is gone!"

9
00:00:46.832 --> 00:00:50.073
Mandy exclaimed as they stood alone in the attic.

10
00:00:51.313 --> 00:00:56.035
The children looked everywhere, but the bag wasn't in the room.

11
00:00:57.695 --> 00:01:03.189
Suddenly Mandy heard a loud bang outside and looked out the window.

12
00:01:03.209 --> 00:01:07.051
"Look, Vinnie," cried Mandy.

13
00:01:07.071 --> 00:01:10.073
"Dad's putting out the trash."

14
00:01:11.454 --> 00:01:14.736
Dad had just put a big box of junk by the street.

15
00:01:15.937 --> 00:01:17.538
"So?" asked Vinnie.

16
00:01:17.558 --> 00:01:21.960
"Silly, I'll bet the album's in there!"

17
00:01:23.261 --> 00:01:27.944
cried Mandy as they watched their father walk into the backyard.

18
00:01:29.312 --> 00:01:32.694
The children ran downstairs and outside to the trash.

19
00:01:34.114 --> 00:01:37.796
Vinnie dove into the box of junk and began to search.

20
00:01:37.816 --> 00:01:39.797
"Here it is!"

21
00:01:40.417 --> 00:01:42.458
he shouted, lifting the bag.

22
00:01:43.698 --> 00:01:48.400
The album was still inside, and they hugged and danced around.

23
00:01:49.661 --> 00:01:53.102
Vinnie and Mandy happily went back into the house.

24
00:01:53.122 --> 00:01:57.404
"That was really close," said Mandy.

25
00:01:58.732 --> 00:02:01.014
"We have to find a better hiding place."

26
00:02:02.235 --> 00:02:05.257
"Let's take it back upstairs," said Vinnie.

27
00:02:06.779 --> 00:02:16.146
Once in the attic, Vinnie asked, "Hey, do you want to And before Mandy could answer, he opened

28
00:02:16.206 --> 00:02:16.747
the album.

29
00:02:16.767 --> 00:02:20.049
"Now this is cool!"

30
00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:21.390
he exclaimed.

31
00:02:22.591 --> 00:02:25.213
The old man was standing on a dusty road.

32
00:02:26.354 --> 00:02:28.156
Two men were standing before him.

33
00:02:29.568 --> 00:02:31.470
One was much younger than the other.

34
00:02:32.791 --> 00:02:36.834
The older man wore a long coat and was firing two guns.

35
00:02:37.995 --> 00:02:40.398
In the air were five glowing objects.

36
00:02:40.418 --> 00:02:44.661
"Is he a cowboy?"

37
00:02:45.262 --> 00:02:45.942
asked Mandy.

38
00:02:45.962 --> 00:02:50.146
"We're about to find out," answered Vinnie.

39
00:02:51.527 --> 00:02:57.092
The children felt their eyes closing and fell down the long, dark tunnel.

40
00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:01.062
They landed on something soft.

41
00:03:02.383 --> 00:03:03.764
Vinnie opened his eyes.

42
00:03:03.784 --> 00:03:06.747
"Where are we?"

43
00:03:07.327 --> 00:03:07.888
he asked.

44
00:03:09.169 --> 00:03:14.253
They lay in a covered wagon among sacks of potatoes, beans, and dried meat.

45
00:03:14.273 --> 00:03:21.300
"This stuff looks like someone is going on a long camping trip," remarked Mandy.

46
00:03:22.661 --> 00:03:26.024
The children had landed on a pile of rolled up blankets.

47
00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:30.261
Mandy noticed some clothing in one corner too.

48
00:03:31.521 --> 00:03:35.762
The wagon was moving slowly, but the ride was bumpy.

49
00:03:35.782 --> 00:03:41.184
"I'm hungry," said Vinnie, opening a sack.

50
00:03:42.544 --> 00:03:44.545
Inside were strips of hard meat.

51
00:03:45.625 --> 00:03:46.485
He picked one up.

52
00:03:46.505 --> 00:03:49.466
"Vinnie! Don't eat that!"

53
00:03:50.086 --> 00:03:50.967
Mandy whispered.

54
00:03:50.987 --> 00:03:55.228
"It looks like beef jerky," Vinnie said.

55
00:03:56.468 --> 00:03:57.268
He smelled it.

56
00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:02.091
Suddenly the wagon stopped.

57
00:04:03.892 --> 00:04:07.834
Then, someone opened part of the heavy cloth covering the wagon.

58
00:04:09.114 --> 00:04:11.575
A man wearing a cowboy hat looked in.

59
00:04:11.595 --> 00:04:18.299
"Well, look what I found in my wagon, boys," he called out, staring at the children.

60
00:04:19.499 --> 00:04:20.820
Vinnie dropped the jerky.
